{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45675","headline":"大蜀高祖潜龙日献陈情偈颂 · 贯休","name":"大蜀高祖潜龙日献陈情偈颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有叟有叟，居岳之室。\n忽振金汤，下彼巉崪。\n闻蜀风景，地宁得一。\n富人侯王，旦奭摩诘。\n龙角日角，紫气盘屈。\n揭日月行，符汤禹出。\n天步孔艰，横流犯跸。\n穆穆蜀俗，整整师律。\n髯发垂雪，忠贞贯日。\n四人苏活，万里丰谧。\n无雨不膏，有露皆滴。\n有叟有叟，无实行实。\n一瓶一衲，既朴且质。\n幸蒙顾盼，词煖恩郁。\n轩镜光中，愿如善吉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}